#var, use command >Rest Client: Switch Environment in search bar of vs code
@id =1

###

### Get all work-experiences
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/work-experiences HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Get work-experience by ID
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/work-experiences/{{id}} HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Create a new work-experience
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/work-experiences HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "company": "Tech Solutions Inc.",
  "status": "active",
  "evidence": [
    {
      "download": "/downloads/certificate-tech-solutions.pdf",
      "fileId": "file123456",
      "link": "https://example.com/certificate",
      "name": "Employment Certificate",
      "type": "application/pdf",
      "uri": "/files/certificate-tech-solutions.pdf"
    }
  ],
  "startDate": "2022-01-15T00:00:00.000Z",
  "endDate": "2023-06-30T00:00:00.000Z",
  "position": "Full Stack Developer",
  "responsibilities": [
    "Developed and maintained web applications",
    "Implemented new features using React and Node.js",
    "Collaborated with cross-functional teams"
  ],
  "experienceType": "full-time",
  "document": "EMP-2022-001",
  "userId": "65fa98765432109876543210"
}

###

### Update an existing work-experience
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/v1/work-experiences/{{id}} HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "company": "Tech Solutions International",
  "status": "active",
  "evidence": [
    {
      "download": "/downloads/certificate-tech-solutions.pdf",
      "fileId": "file123456",
      "link": "https://example.com/certificate",
      "name": "Employment Certificate",
      "type": "application/pdf",
      "uri": "/files/certificate-tech-solutions.pdf"
    },
    {
      "download": "/downloads/recommendation-letter.pdf",
      "fileId": "file789012",
      "link": "https://example.com/recommendation",
      "name": "Recommendation Letter",
      "type": "application/pdf",
      "uri": "/files/recommendation-letter.pdf"
    }
  ],
  "startDate": "2022-01-15T00:00:00.000Z",
  "endDate": "2023-08-15T00:00:00.000Z",
  "position": "Senior Full Stack Developer",
  "responsibilities": [
    "Developed and maintained web applications",
    "Implemented new features using React and Node.js",
    "Led a team of junior developers",
    "Conducted code reviews and mentored team members"
  ],
  "experienceType": "full-time",
  "document": "EMP-2022-001-UPDATED",
  "userId": "65fa98765432109876543210"
}

###

### Delete a work-experience
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/v1/work-experiences/{{id}} HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
